		"Name": "Banshee",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Magistracy of Canopus ended up with the lion's share of the Light Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Banshee BNC-4MC. The BNC-4MC is based on the earlier -3MC but uses a little more advanced technology than that venerable design does. Clad in Heavy Ferro-Fibrous armor for protection and weight savings, the -4MC uses the -3MC's Autocannon/10 for primary firepowre but backs it up with a trio of Light Plasma Rifles for ranged support and harassment. CASE protects the AC/10's ammunition bin while the Light Plasma Rifle ammo bins require no such protection.",
